== Trivia ==
*Prior to update 0.16.1, the '''Terminator''' required {{Green|3}} stacked {{Item|Null Blade}}s: since {{Item|Null Blade}}s took the model of {{Item|Shears}}, which are unstackable, the '''Terminator''' could only be crafted through Quick Craft and the recipe was effectively exclusive to ranked Hypixel players.

